# NOTE: outputs/ and logs/ are intentionally NOT ignored here. Both are
# normally regenerated at runtime (outputs/Dataset_Harmonized.csv on every
# search, logs/usage_*.jsonl on every search a real evaluator runs), but the
# ones currently committed are kept as evidence that the pipeline and the
# audit-logging feature actually work end to end, for this project's
# academic submission. Feel free to re-add "outputs/*.csv", "outputs/*.txt"
# and "logs/*.jsonl" here once that's no longer needed (e.g. for the bank
# handoff, where a fresh deployment should start with empty logs).
